# 4. Available Tools

The server currently exposes three tools.

| Tool | Purpose | Status |
|------|---------|--------|
| investigate_order | Diagnose why an order cannot proceed through fulfillment | Implemented |
| list_blocked_orders | Return every order currently held in BLOCKED status | Implemented |
| get_order_timeline | Display the lifecycle events of an order | Implemented |
| execute_resolution | Execute a predefined operational resolution | Planned |

Each tool is designed around an operational task rather than CRUD functionality.

All implemented tools are read-only and are annotated with `readOnlyHint`, so clients
may call them without a write confirmation prompt.

